    <description>Person 2 entry point from the Person 1 hand-off. "Request Sample" on a qualified Lead: marks Sample Requested on the lead, converts it to Account + Contact via Apex (matching an existing customer by company name), maps lead fields, finds or creates the Opportunity at Stage = Sample Requested, and creates Sample Request #1. Consumes the frozen Lead API names only.</description>
